<title>LATVIA: DAUGAVPILS FORESTRY SHARE LIST. [CORRECTED 17:55 GMT]</title>
<headline>DAUGAVPILS FORESTRY SHARE LIST. [CORRECTED 17:55 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects company name in headline and throughout).</p>
<p>The central depository said on</p>
<p>Thursday that some 85 percent of Daugavpils Forestry shares</p>
<p>have been blocked ahead of its shareholder meeting on April 4.</p>
<p>Some 27,329 shares were not blocked ahead of the deadline.</p>
<p>The shares have to be blocked for shareholders to take part in</p>
<p>the meeting.</p>
<p>Daugavpils total share capital is 180,000 shares.</p>
<p>The depository gave a list of the biggest shareholders,</p>
<p>controlling in total some 152,671 shares.</p>
